 "pdf": "ads125h02.pdf",
 "pages": "ads125h02.pdf (SBAS790C) p.4-5 pin configuration and functions, p.6 recommended operating conditions (DVDD 2.7-5.25 V), p.8-9 digital characteristics (GPIO VIH 0.7 AVDD, other inputs 0.7 DVDD), p.9 timing requirements, p.10 switching characteristics (tp(CSDO) 50 ns, tp(SCDO1) 40 ns, tp(CSDOZ) 50 ns), p.39-41 conversion control, latency (Table 8), auto-zero, clock, p.45-46 serial interface (SPI mode 1, CS1/CS2), DRDY, p.47 conversion data, CRC, p.49-52 commands (Table 16-27), p.52-67 register map (Table 28-44)",
 "notModeled": [
  "analog inputs, high-voltage PGA, input mux (MODE4.MUX stored; HV supply readback, VCOM short and temperature readings not computed), IDACs, reference mux, PGA/reference alarms (STATUS1 and REFALM stay 0)",
  "two chip selects: CS2 selects the PGA register block (10h-12h) and CS1 the ADC block (00h-0Fh); the model has one bus on CS1 and reaches all 19 registers through it; CS2 is not used",
  "CRC is always on: every command is 4 bytes (byte 2 arbitrary or WREG data, byte 3 CRC-2, byte 4 00h) and executes at the 32nd SCLK; the model decodes the 4 bytes without checking the CRC; DOUT/DRDY outputs FFh then 1s during the command bytes (the echo bytes 1-2 and Out CRC-2 are not output), and the Out CRC-1/-3/-4 bytes after register or conversion data are not output; CRC1/CRC2 error flags never set",
  "optional STATUS0 byte before the conversion data (MODE3.STATENB = 1) is not output",
  "conversion time is the Table 8 latency (50 us start delay, auto-zero off) for every conversion; continuous conversions after the first run at 1 / fDATA; auto-zero doubles the first latency; DELAY[3:0] other than 0001 adds to it; FIR is defined only at 2.5, 5, 10, 20 SPS and sinc5 is used at 14.4 kSPS and above (undefined combinations use the largest time)",
  "conversion restart on writes to MODE0, MODE1 and REF (Table 28 Restart column)",
  "LOCK / UNLOCK set the LOCK flags but register writes are not blocked; per-block locking by CS1/CS2 not modeled",
  "DRDY pulses high 16 fCLK before the next completion in continuous mode when data was not read (tw(DRH))",
  "OFSCAL / GANCAL calibrations (OFCAL/FSCAL not updated)",
  "GPIO pins (AVDD domain, MODE2/MODE3 stored only); external clock on CLKIN (40 kSPS needs fCLK = 10.24 MHz; times use the datasheet values)",
